Basic Setup

1.Create project folder & init

mkdir ecommerce-backend
cd ecommerce-backend
git init
npm init -y

2.Install core packages

npm i express dotenv bcrypt jsonwebtoken pg pg-hstore sequelize sequelize-cli multer cors helmet joi
# dev
npm i -D nodemon eslint prettier

3.Quick useful package.json scripts (edit)

"scripts": {
  "dev": "nodemon src/server.js",
  "start": "node src/server.js",
  "migrate": "npx sequelize-cli db:migrate",
  "migrate:undo": "npx sequelize-cli db:migrate:undo",
  "migrate:undo:all": "npx sequelize-cli db:migrate:undo:all"
}

4.Create project layout

ecommerce-backend/
├─ src/
│  ├─ controllers/
│  ├─ models/
│  ├─ migrations/
│  ├─ seeders/
│  ├─ routes/
│  ├─ middleware/
│  ├─ services/
│  ├─ utils/
│  └─ server.js
├─ config/
│  └─ config.js (sequelize)
├─ .sequelizerc
├─ .env